        {
          "text": "ino swebo tulayokoka buti, twanoobausya kufutuka ukukungulukide kulindiswe? Oku kufutuka kwakasaangunwa kwaambwa Mwami mwini, kwakasinizigwa kulindiswe kuzwa kulibaabo abakamvwa. ",
