        {
          "text": "Awalo Leza wakalungulula ambabo muzitondezyo amumalele amuzimpangaliko zinjizinji, akukwaabilwa kwa-Muuya Uusalala, mbubonya mbuli kuyanda kwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
