                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walo wakeelelwa naakaleta bana banjibanji kubulemu, (alimwi nceziliwo zintu zyoonse nkaambo kakwe, zyoonse zili mulinguwe), kuti abe ngosibinda uulondokede wakufutuka kwabo kukupenga kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
